/backend/.env

# Android / Gradle
# local.properties holds the absolute SDK path of whoever generated it, and on
# some setups an sdk.dir with a signing keystore next to it. Never commit it.
local.properties
.gradle/
build/
captures/
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
*.jks

# Keys / secrets — the 10/08 submission checklist checks for these by hand,
# this is the belt to that braces.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Team credentials. docs/link.md held the CarSky account and password in clear
# text and was tracked until 01/08; see docs/link.example.md. The repo is part
# of the submission, and the rules (3.6) forbid publishing platform internals.
docs/link.md

# Local artifact-generation workspaces and inspection sidecars.
.tmp/
*.pptx.inspect.ndjson

# Benchmark audio that noise_mix.py DERIVES. Every file is reproduced
# byte-for-byte from the clean source plus a fixed per-clip seed, so ~12 MB of
# WAV in the history would buy nothing that `py scripts/noise_mix.py` does not.
# corpus-index.csv (the SNR actually achieved per file) stays tracked — that is
# the part a reviewer needs and cannot regenerate without the audio.
evidence/asr/corpus/**/*.wav
evidence/asr/corpus-v12/**/*.wav
evidence/asr/corpus-human/clean/**/*.wav
evidence/asr/corpus-human/quiet/**/*.wav
evidence/asr/corpus-human/cabin/**/*.wav
evidence/asr/corpus-human/highway/**/*.wav

# NOT ignored, deliberately: evidence/asr/corpus-src/*.wav — the rendered
# Vietnamese command clips. They need a vi-VN Windows voice that most of the
# team's machines do not have, so they are authored input, not derived output.
# evidence/asr/corpus-human/raw/*.wav is also authored input: real recordings
# that cannot be reproduced from source code. Only its derived noise levels are
# ignored above.

# Byte-code Python sinh ra khi chay cac script VHAL/DTC o thu muc goc.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Bao cao do embedded/test_safety_scenario_pack.py sinh ra vao CWD khi chay.
# Ban duoc giu lam bang chung nam o evidence/ablation/safety-scenario-pack-*.csv,
# tai lap byte-for-byte bang: cd embedded && python test_safety_scenario_pack.py
/viva_safety_scenario_report.csv
/viva_ablation_a1_report.csv
/embedded/viva_safety_scenario_report.csv
/embedded/viva_ablation_a1_report.csv

# Google Cloud service-account keys (never commit)
**/secrets/
**/fintrack-*.json
**/*-service-account*.json
automotive/fintrack-*.json
